# Mandap Billing System - AI Agent Routing

# RULES
- **Always read @01-system-architecture.md** for project context.
- **Always follow @02-security-guardrails.md** for security.
- **Always adhere to @03-code-style.md** for coding standards.
- Prefer **Progressive Disclosure**: Only load domain/skill context when needed.

# ROUTING
- **Security/Auth tasks?** Read @authentication.mdc
- **Inventory/Stock tasks?** Read @inventory.mdc
- **Billing/Orders tasks?** Read @billing-rental.mdc
- **New Feature/API?** Use @api-generator.md
- **Database changes?** Use @db-migration.md

# AGENT MODES
- **Architect Mode (@architect-agent.md)**: Use for planning, refactoring, and complex design.
- **UI/UX Mode (@ui-ux-agent.md)**: Use for frontend development and design tasks.

# PROJECT SETTINGS
- **Backend Profile**: Java 17 + Spring Boot 3.x + MySQL for Database + Maven as build tool.
- **Frontend Framework**: Angular 21
- **Styling**: Tailwind 4 + DaisyUI 5
- **Business Rule**: One Order / One Bill per customer per season.
